    "steam_appid": 1453840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST DREAMOUT</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453840/extras/10ba34bebeaa14994bc094c9d1d1e5a3.poster.avif?t=1739491172\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453840/extras/10ba34bebeaa14994bc094c9d1d1e5a3.webm?t=1739491172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453840/extras/10ba34bebeaa14994bc094c9d1d1e5a3.mp4?t=1739491172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The game takes place in 2040. From the headquarters of Arctic comes a statement about finding the new organisms. You and your team are going to a research expedition to study the unknown organisms. The research gets out of control and one or even more people are infected with a new unknown deadly virus &quot;Virus-40&quot;. The virus clouds people\u2019s judgement and forces them to infect the others with a deadly virus in order to ruin the expedition.<br><br>Players are divided into 2 roles:<br>\u2022Infected - whose main goal is to infect everyone else, to deny being infection and blend in with other members of the expedition.<br>\u2022Healthy - find the infected person and cure him/her with an antidote and prove that you are healthy to others, and also to survive it is necessary to maintain the station in staff state.<br><br>If the antidote is administered to a healthy person, then the medicine will have the opposite fatal effect.<br><br>Features:<br>- Voice and text chat<br>- Exciting quests<br>- Bonus system<br>- Secret locations<br>- Nice soundtrack<br>- Anonymous voting<br>- Beautiful visuals",
    "about_the_game": "The game takes place in 2040. From the headquarters of Arctic comes a statement about finding the new organisms. You and your team are going to a research expedition to study the unknown organisms. The research gets out of control and one or even more people are infected with a new unknown deadly virus &quot;Virus-40&quot;. The virus clouds people\u2019s judgement and forces them to infect the others with a deadly virus in order to ruin the expedition.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers are divided into 2 roles:<br />\r\n\u2022Infected - whose main goal is to infect everyone else, to deny being infection and blend in with other members of the expedition.<br />\r\n\u2022Healthy - find the infected person and cure him/her with an antidote and prove that you are healthy to others, and also to survive it is necessary to maintain the station in staff state.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf the antidote is administered to a healthy person, then the medicine will have the opposite fatal effect.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Voice and text chat<br />\r\n- Exciting quests<br />\r\n- Bonus system<br />\r\n- Secret locations<br />\r\n- Nice soundtrack<br />\r\n- Anonymous voting<br />\r\n- Beautiful visuals",
    "short_description": "This is a casual online first-person game for 4-10 players in which you have to identify the infected and cured him or be infected and infect everyone!",
